Parts of this project's design are adapted from pstack
(https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack), used under the MIT License below.
Adapted ideas include: the always-on principle index, attack-the-premise,
root-cause fixing, behavior-focused tests, evidence levels (from blast-radius),
measurement checks (from benchmark-checklist), plain-writing rules (from unslop
and technical-writing), per-role model settings (from setup-pstack), and
throwaway prototypes (from exhaust-the-design-space).

